# WordPress site onboarding — the *.csv/failures rules carry live admin
# credentials and generated Application Passwords for every connected site.
# Never committed, regardless of location; kept here defensively even though
# the tool also refuses to run inside a git-tracked directory (see onboard.js).
# node_modules here is just the ordinary "don't commit installed packages"
# rule — the top-level /node_modules above is root-anchored and doesn't
# reach this nested one.
ops/wordpress-onboarding/*.csv
ops/wordpress-onboarding/failures/
ops/wordpress-onboarding/node_modules/
